<h1>draw_get_halign</h1>
<p>This function is used to get the text alignment setting along the horizontal axis, and will return one of the constants listed below.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code">draw_get_halign();</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Constant"><a target="_blank" href="../../../GML_Overview/Variables/Constants.htm">Constant</a></span></p>
<div data-conref="../../../../assets/snippets/Table_halign.hts">
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Constant</th>
<th>Alignment</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="inline">fa_left</span></td>
<td style="text-align: center"><img src="../../../../assets/Images/Scripting_Reference/GML/Reference/Drawing/fa_left.png" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="inline">fa_center</span></td>
<td style="text-align: center"><img src="../../../../assets/Images/Scripting_Reference/GML/Reference/Drawing/fa_center.png" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="inline">fa_right</span></td>
<td style="text-align: center"><img src="../../../../assets/Images/Scripting_Reference/GML/Reference/Drawing/fa_right.png" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><br/>
</p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">var _cur_halign = draw_get_halign();<br/>
var _cur_valign = draw_get_valign();<br/>
<br/>
draw_set_halign(fa_right);<br/>
draw_set_valign(fa_bottom);<br/>
<br/>
draw_text(100, 32, &quot;Score: &quot; + string(score));<br/>
<br/>
draw_set_halign(_cur_halign);<br/>
draw_set_valign(_cur_valign);
</p>
<p>The above code saves the currently applied &quot;halign&quot; and &quot;valign&quot; values to local variables, and then changes the alignments to draw some text. After drawing it, it resets the alignments back to the values stored in the local variables.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
